
@startuml
title Figure 6 — Low-code node creation and instant registration

' --- Minimal, compact style for sequence diagrams ---
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam Participant {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
scale 0.9


actor Developer
participant "Low-Code Creator" as LCC
participant "File System" as FS
participant "Registry/Loader" as REG
participant "Node Editor" as Editor

Developer -> LCC: Generate skeleton (Python / Polyglot)
LCC -> FS: write node file(s)
LCC -> REG: refresh discovery
REG -> Editor: add to palette (Custom)

@enduml
